# ============================================================================
# Dead Arrival map: THEATER OF THE DAMNED
# An abandoned playhouse. You start backstage; buy your way through the
# doors to the auditorium, the lobby and the dressing rooms.
# spawn_mode = barriers  -> zombies tear through boards at the barriers,
# preferring the ones in the room you are currently in
# ============================================================================
